<title>ESTONIA: GOVERNMENT TO DISCUSS 1998 BUDGET PROJECT.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT TO DISCUSS 1998 BUDGET PROJECT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's government will on tomorrow discuss the state budget project for 1998, the finance ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;According to the project, the budget amount is 13.726 billion kroons, which is an increase of 9.7 percent compared to this year,&quot; Aili Ohlau, spokesperson for the ministry, told Reuters.</p>
<p>The government earlier said its priority is regional policy in the 1998 state budget.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
